    "description": "You are fury incarnate. You enrage upon rolling initiative and unleash the fury within. Whilst raging, you gain the following benefits:\n• Boon on all Strength Tests that aren't attacks;\n• Your melee strikes hit hard and deal +2 damage; and\n• Your muscles are like steel; count as t2 armour. Agility Tests remain unburdened, and no force can reduce this protection below t2 whilst raging.\nYour rage ends once the encounter is over.",
